# Order Lifecycle

> **Source:** `lib/order-state-machine.ts`, `app/api/webhooks/xendit/route.ts`

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> pending: Order created

    pending --> paid: Xendit webhook (PAID/SETTLED)
    pending --> cancelled: Buyer cancel / Xendit EXPIRED/FAILED
    pending --> cancelled: Admin cancel

    paid --> processing: Auto (seller confirmed)
    paid --> refunded: Admin refund

    processing --> ready_for_pickup: Seller marks ready
    processing --> cancelled: Seller cancel (no stock)
    processing --> cancelled: Admin cancel

    ready_for_pickup --> out_for_delivery: Courier accepts/picks up
    ready_for_pickup --> cancelled: Buyer cancel / timeout

    out_for_delivery --> completed: Courier delivers (Biteship DELIVERED)
    out_for_delivery --> cancelled: Shipment failed/returned

    completed --> [*]
    cancelled --> [*]
    refunded --> [*]

    note right of paid
        invoice_state:
        pending → paid
    end note

    note right of cancelled
        If unpaid: release stock
        If paid: refund + release stock
        Release promo code
    end note
```

---

## State Details

| State | `order_status` | `payment_status` | `invoice_state` |
|-------|---------------|-----------------|-----------------|
| Created | `pending` | `unpaid` | `pending` |
| Paid | `processing` | `paid` | `paid` |
| Ready | `ready_for_pickup` | `paid` | `paid` |
| Out for Delivery | `out_for_delivery` | `paid` | `paid` |
| Completed | `completed` | `paid` | `paid` |
| Cancelled (unpaid) | `cancelled` | `failed` | `failed` |
| Cancelled (paid) | `cancelled` | `refunded` | `refunded` |
| Refunded | `cancelled` | `refunded` | `refunded` |

---

## Transition Guards

| From | To | Guard |
|------|----|-------|
| `pending` | `paid` | Xendit webhook + amount match |
| `pending` | `cancelled` | Buyer/admin action |
| `paid` | `processing` | Seller confirms / auto |
| `processing` | `ready_for_pickup` | Seller action |
| `ready_for_pickup` | `out_for_delivery` | Courier accepts |
| `out_for_delivery` | `completed` | Biteship DELIVERED |
| `paid` | `refunded` | Admin refund action |

**Invalid transitions (blocked):**
- `completed` → any
- `cancelled` → any
- `refunded` → any
- `paid` → `pending` (can't unpay)
- `out_for_delivery` → `ready_for_pickup` (can't go back)

